Words
  The opening and closing lines on screen are from Guru Nanak's salok in the Guru Granth Sahib (ang 1412):
  "ਜਉ ਤਉ ਪ੍ਰੇਮ ਖੇਲਣ ਕਾ ਚਾਉ ॥ ਸਿਰੁ ਧਰਿ ਤਲੀ ਗਲੀ ਮੇਰੀ ਆਉ ॥ ... ਸਿਰੁ ਦੀਜੈ ਕਾਣਿ ਨ ਕੀਜੈ ॥". The narrator speaks a modern Punjabi paraphrase.

Voice
  voyage-home.mp4 (Punjabi): ElevenLabs text-to-speech (Eleven v3), voice "Sufi - Wise Punjabi Conversation" from the
    ElevenLabs voice library, generated on the user's paid ElevenLabs plan. Use is under ElevenLabs' terms for that plan.
  voyage-home-english.mp4: ElevenLabs (Multilingual v2), voice "Ranbir - Warm and Friendly", same plan and terms.
  voyage-home-female.mp4 and voyage-home-male.mp4: Microsoft Edge neural text-to-speech, voices
    "en-IN-NeerjaExpressiveNeural" and "en-IN-PrabhatNeural", through edge-tts (LGPL-3.0). An online Microsoft service:
    check Microsoft's terms for the use you intend before publishing commercially.

Music and sound
  Original score and all sound effects are synthesised in mix.py.
  The plucked string uses the library's physical model (core/audio/pluck.py); the flute, drone, drum and foley are numpy synthesis.
  No samples or recordings are used.

Picture
  Painted entirely in code. The stroke engine (engine.js) comes from the Lemo-Opuscar Watercolor Brush style.
  No photographs, maps or archive images are used. The figures are not likenesses.

